OL,3,GNEWSAStrangers at festival help
OL,4,Aautistic man realise dream
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing the festival, Andy shared a
OL,7,Fthank-you post to the "lads from
OL,8,FBristol" on social media which went
OL,9,Fviral. Andy said: "It's been lovely to
OL,10,Fsee my son have all of his dreams
OL,11,Frealised in the past week."
